# Secrets — never commit real environment values
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
# Exception: the frontend production API URL is not a secret (every Vite
# VITE_-prefixed var is bundled into public JS regardless) and is
# deliberately committed as a permanent source of truth for `vite build`
# — see .env.production's own header comment for why.
!.env.production
server/scripts/setup-db.sql
server/scripts/setup-db.production.sql

